==Latin==

===Etymology 1===
{{etymon|la|id=to speak|inh|itc-pro>*deikō>to show}}
From {{inh|la|itc-pro|*deikō}}, from {{inh|la|ine-pro|*déyḱti||to show, point out}} (reformed as a thematic verb). The perfect forms are derived from {{inh|la|ine-pro|*dḗyḱst}}.

Cognates include {{cog|osc|𐌃𐌄𐌝𐌊𐌖𐌌||to show, point out}}, {{cog|sa|दिशति|tr=diśáti}}, {{cog|grc|δείκνυμι}} and {{cog|ang|tǣċan}} (English {{m|en|teach}}).

====Alternative forms====
* {{alt|la|deicō}} {{qual|archaic}}

====Pronunciation====
